  Strings:
  - EntryId: 47251901
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.start.01
    Value: I'm exhausted... I need to rest for a while.
  - EntryId: 90593698
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.start.02
    Value: Let's get inside quickly.
  - EntryId: 54843612
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.hallway.01
    Value: This is my home.
  - EntryId: 31975553
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.entering.0.turnlight
    Value: I should turn on the lights first.
  - EntryId: 79649948
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.entering.01
    Value: Phew... Finally home.
  - EntryId: 35771164
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.entering.02
    Value: I can finally get some rest.
  - EntryId: 38887963
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.dropBackPack.01
    Value: Let me put my bag down first.
  - EntryId: 83938182
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.entering.03
    Value: I'm a little hungry... Should I eat first?
  - EntryId: 32038591
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.Scene1.1
    Value: A phone like this...
  - EntryId: 94490215
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.Scene1.2
    Value: Was this always in my house...?
  - EntryId: 90251430
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.Scene1.3
    Value: I'm too tired to worry about it.
  - EntryId: 91861710
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.goToilet.01
    Value: I suddenly need to take a dump.
  - EntryId: 85123224
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.goToSleep.01
    Value: Phew, time for bed?
  - EntryId: 71467175
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.goToSleep.Bell.01
    Value: That scared me!!
  - EntryId: 92129515
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.goToSleep.Bell.02
    Value: Who could that be at this hour?
  - EntryId: 96426880
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.memo.01
    Value: ........
  - EntryId: 38555188
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.memo.02
    Value: Someone's just messing with me, right?
  - EntryId: 18922430
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.goToSleep.Bell.03
    Value: You're not getting away with it this time!!
  - EntryId: 80218925
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.answer.1.1
    Value: .................
  - EntryId: 97221779
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.answer.1.2
    Value: What the hell...?
  - EntryId: 50745910
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.answer.1.3
    Value: I must just be really tired...
  - EntryId: 45707549
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.hallway.2.01
    Value: Wha... What?! How did this happen?
  - EntryId: 95546813
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.answer.2.1
    Value: Look behind you.
  - EntryId: 54326865
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.returnhome.1.1
    Value: What the hell just happened?
  - EntryId: 35895386
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.answer.4.1
    Value: Bedroom.
  - EntryId: 56045720
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.answer.after.4.1
    Value: I'd better grab a flashlight, just in case.
  - EntryId: 39312843
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.findFlashlight
    Value: I'm finding a flashlight before I go in.
  - EntryId: 94967976
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.hallway2.phone
    Value: ...Open it.
  - EntryId: 73121576
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.hallway2.npc.talk1
    Value: 'Stranger : You startled me.'
  - EntryId: 62985988
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.hallway2.npc.talk2
    Value: 'Stranger : There wasn''t a door here until you showed up.'
  - EntryId: 12788384
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.hallway2.npc.talk3
    Value: "Stranger : If you go through the door\u2026 you should be able to get
      back."
  - EntryId: 60024599
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.home.npc.talk1
    Value: 'Stranger : Now you just need to open the last door.'
  - EntryId: 80955542
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.home.npc.talk2
    Value: 'Stranger : ................(Says nothing)'
  - EntryId: 92999695
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.answer.7.1
    Value: ...........Don't open the door.
  - EntryId: 65509164
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.npc.last.talk1
    Value: This is the right door.
  - EntryId: 95681721
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.Telephone.last.1
    Value: Whatever you do, don't open the door.
  - EntryId: 67946711
    SectionId: 82386491
    Key: Subtitle.player.last
    Value: Wha... What is it...??
  - EntryId: 37567559
    SectionId: 60438809
    Key: Objectives.eneteringHome.title
    Value: Enter your home
